          "title": "Elimination Blackjack",
          "subtitle": "Gambling",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Elimination Blackjack is a commercial blackjack tournament format combining dealer play with periodic player elimination."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Invented by Russ Hamilton and used on the Ultimate Blackjack Tour, Elimination Blackjack adds no-limit tournament pressure and scheduled eliminations to blackjack."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
